  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that understands and engages with misogynistic stereotypes, particularly those that generalize and demean men by equating them with pigs. The target community likely includes individuals who are familiar with or enjoy using derogatory gender-based humor, and who may be part of online communities that perpetuate or celebrate such hateful generalizations. The meme’s intent to insult and demean men through a harmful stereotype suggests it is aimed at an audience that either supports or finds amusement in gender-based discrimination, particularly from a patriarchal perspective.",
